        <mxCell id="b23Va0gJ9b99xPEQdqbP-31" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#9AA0A6;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=16;align=left;verticalAlign=top;arcSize=6;spacing=8;" value="Configuration serialised and hashed before execution. The working tree held uncommitted notebook edits at freezing, so the executed state is identified by a SHA-256 manifest over archived notebooks and outputs rather than by the commit alone.&#xa;&#xa;Item-level predictions retained for the five-seed matrix (90 files: row id, gold, predicted, probability, fitted temperature). Elsewhere, per-seed tables with checksums. Paired seed-level comparisons need only a macro-F1 per seed per arm and remain computable; analyses that re-score individual items are reproducible over the five retained seeds. Raw comment text is not redistributed." vertex="1">
